      "created_at": "2015-09-13T18:59:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Long time listener, first caller. I wrote a Sentinels game generator app for my gaming group because we play a couple of games every day.</p><p>I had a link to the play store but then realized that could be construed as a marketing attempt and I want to follow the rules.</p><p>What is the best way to let people know about it?</p>",
