      "created_at": "2015-09-14T02:26:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Are you charging for it? If not, then I wouldn't call it marketing at all.</p><p>But either way, what's new about it? Why is it better than the existing one(s)?</p><p>(If you're charging, you'll need some really compelling use-case to get people to use it.)</p>",
