      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/f08c70/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-09-14T04:18:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Nope. &nbsp;Totally free.</p><p>The existing apps work great, but didn't provide some of the functionality that my gaming group used. &nbsp;We like to have the villain nemesis as an option. &nbsp;Also, we like to have an extra hero so players have some choice.</p><p>It is an Android app, so I tried to use some of the more recent design and navigation patterns.</p><p>https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.flqsoft.sotm</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
